#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:5 5d8e88b9136f469d9e9159896112b007
msgid "Pilot Control"
msgstr "飞手控制"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:7 456f69870b8a4d64ac3d77d80af9bb33
msgid "Control of the vehicle can be accomplished in three ways:"
msgstr "飞行器的控制可通过以下三种方式实现："

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:9 484b98b5fafb4667b90035a7b4968f38
msgid "Via Ground Control Stations using:"
msgstr "通过地面控制站使用："

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:11 c747c1b544f14980980f28d8c51d2652
msgid ""
"GCS attached Joysticks, or command lines, to send `MAVLink RC overrides "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html#alternatives>`__ that"
" act as RC inputs (even if no RC receiver is attached)"
msgstr ""
"连接到地面站的摇杆或命令行，发送 `MAVLink 遥控覆盖 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html#alternatives>`__ "
"作为遥控输入（即使未连接遥控接收机）"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:12 3b1a29470b3a4c60b2eb287d20460387
msgid ""
"The `MAVLink Manual Control protocol "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html>`__, which includes "
"axis commands and button states."
msgstr ""
"`MAVLink 手动控制协议 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/manual_control.html>`__，包含轴控制命令和按钮状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:14 1326cbb767034ca58d9588b7d418ba54
msgid ""
"For `legacy reasons "
"<https://github.com/ardupilot/ardupilot/issues/8818>`__, ArduSub's "
"`MANUAL_CONTROL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MANUAL_CONTROL>`__ support "
"expects Z-axis values in range [0,1000], instead of the specification "
"range [-1000,1000]."
msgstr ""
"出于 `历史原因 <https://github.com/ardupilot/ardupilot/issues/8818>`__，ArduSub "
"的 `MANUAL_CONTROL "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MANUAL_CONTROL>`__ 支持期望 Z "
"轴值范围为 [0,1000]，而非规范范围 [-1000,1000]。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:16 11b5ae514bb8406aadc69c0c56c19398
msgid "RC control (not enabled by default)"
msgstr "遥控控制（默认未启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:19 2a5d2495eab94dc2b999f56b747ecf5e
msgid "Pilot Control Inputs"
msgstr "飞手控制输入"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:20 7446d2524bdc43319c22f2b836d50f8e
msgid ""
"If RC is not enabled, pilot inputs are via the GCS joystick, controlling "
"the vehicle's available motion axes, including yaw and attitude "
"rotations, along with body-frame translations laterally, forward/back, "
"and up/down in depth. Additionally, lights and camera can be controlled "
"from the GCS, as well as some generic servo and/or relay outputs."
msgstr "若未启用遥控，飞手输入通过地面站摇杆进行，控制飞行器的可用运动轴，包括偏航和姿态旋转，以及机体坐标系下的横向、前后和深度上下平移。此外，还可通过地面站控制灯光和摄像头，以及部分通用舵机和/或继电器输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:22 ccf286d888ab425b92aadc890905a509
msgid ""
"If RC is enabled, then the pitch/roll/yaw/throttle/lateral/forward inputs"
" are sent from the RC transmitter and mapped from RC channels to these "
"inputs via the ``RCMAP_`` parameters."
msgstr "若启用了遥控，则俯仰/横滚/偏航/油门/横向/前向输入由遥控发射机发送，并通过 ``RCMAP_`` 参数将遥控通道映射至相应输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:25 4beafbafcfac408ebf4d15a485a2b971
msgid "Pilot Control Freedoms by Mode"
msgstr "各模式下的飞手控制自由度"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:26 84ef3b5b0b344b869dfe4aed41e36f2f
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The following assumes the axis is controllable. Some frame configurations"
" do not provide all axes. For example the SimpleROV-3 frame has three "
"thrusters providing only yaw, forward, and depth control. The pitch and "
"roll attitude is uncontrolled and relies on CG/ballast trimming and has "
"no lateral movement capability."
msgstr ""
"以下内容假设该轴可控。某些机架配置并不提供所有轴的控制能力。例如，SimpleROV-3 "
"机架具有三个推进器，仅提供偏航、前向和深度控制。俯仰和横滚姿态不受控，依赖重心/压载配平，且无横向运动能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:28 7274da4c9a4e4ebd9906a19e3fd03828
msgid "ANG = Angle target. Stick deflection indicates desired axis angle."
msgstr "ANG = 角度目标。摇杆偏转表示期望的轴角度。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:30 b89d77a9a7f24076a484c3816b29f619
msgid ""
"RAT = Rate target. Stick deflection indicates desired axis "
"movement/rotation rate."
msgstr "RAT = 角速率目标。摇杆偏转表示期望的轴运动/旋转速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:32 36485639f5a34de8b398370bd21edb31
msgid "D = Direct motor output based on stick deflection."
msgstr "D = 基于摇杆偏转的直接电机输出。"

