#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:48 88a8dceb6cfc47aab238ede44e0142b7
msgid ""
"\\*SURFTRAK maintains depth as a relative position above the sea floor "
"using a rangefinder when there in no depth input change requested by the "
"pilot."
msgstr "\\*当飞手未请求深度输入变化时，SURFTRAK 使用测距仪将深度保持为相对于海底的固定距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:50 d26f4e72f7a64a18b64e24eb4ea7f496
msgid "MODE AUTO: Autopilot commands necessary controls to navigate the mission."
msgstr "AUTO 模式：飞控发出必要的控制指令以执行任务导航。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:51 c431d1cfe6c8489f8f31ce2d67a90aaf
msgid ""
"MODE GUIDED: Pilot can control Roll and Pitch if in velocity control mode"
" with stick input signifying angle targets if in HEADING HOLD, or rate "
"targets, otherwise. Yaw input is rate demand. LATERAL and FORWARD inputs "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"GUIDED 模式：若处于速度控制模式，飞手可控制横滚和俯仰；在 HEADING HOLD "
"时摇杆输入表示角度目标，其他情况下表示速率目标。偏航输入为速率需求，横向和前向输入被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:54 35d2802a8725475d9f102aa4d14b2184
msgid "Failsafes"
msgstr "失效保护"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:56 fb704f66b62b4763b686d591b4806b5a
msgid ""
"Several failsafes are provided for pilot control methods, if they fail, "
"any or all of which may be configured and enabled:"
msgstr "针对飞手控制方式提供了多种失效保护，当控制失效时，可配置并启用其中任意一种或全部："

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:58 1229a254e13f4d3aa671bc34cadf5c0b
msgid ":ref:`Pilot Control failsafe <pilot-control-failsafe>`"
msgstr ":ref:`飞手控制失控保护 <pilot-control-failsafe>`"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:59 6151940c974e45a28148b23acb6879c0
msgid ":ref:`RC Failsafe <radio-failsafe>` (if RC is enabled)"
msgstr ":ref:`遥控失控保护 <radio-failsafe>` （若已启用遥控）"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:60 8db8bd3522ee4b6cac48ae9536daeef3
msgid ":ref:`GCS (Heartbeat) Failsafe <gcs-failsafe>`"
msgstr ":ref:`地面站（心跳）失控保护 <gcs-failsafe>`"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:63 b6acc840d657492085de2633a9cc7e9a
msgid "Responsiveness"
msgstr "响应灵敏度"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:64 1dd5bc3451bd44568ca823953d72a727
msgid ""
"Depending on vehicle design and pilot experience, it can be desirable to "
"limit how quickly and/or strongly the vehicle responds to control inputs."
" There are a few different approaches to doing this, which affect "
"different parts of the control pipeline:"
msgstr "根据飞行器设计和飞手经验，有时需要限制飞行器响应控制输入的速度和/或力度。有几种不同的方法可以实现这一目的，它们作用于控制管线的不同部分："

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:66 12bd13f6170547eda4f584128b3752f0
msgid ""
"If a GCS joystick is used, the ``JS_GAIN_*`` parameters scale the pilot "
"input range, which determines  how much pilot joystick inputs can affect "
"motor outputs"
msgstr "若使用地面站摇杆，``JS_GAIN_*`` 参数缩放飞手输入范围，决定飞手摇杆输入对推进器输出的影响程度"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:68 35cf2aeace164c70bb11ec1f8543be71
msgid ""
"In MANUAL mode there are only pilot inputs, so the total output range "
"(and hence power usage) of the vehicle is determined by the pilot's input"
" control range, whether GCS joystick based or RC based"
msgstr "在 MANUAL 模式下，仅有飞手输入，因此飞行器的总输出范围（进而决定功耗）由飞手输入控制范围决定，无论是基于地面站摇杆还是遥控"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:69 fa078037201242f58c75a127cd3d70b0
msgid ""
"In modes with autopilot stabilisation, stabilisation can still cause the "
"vehicle to use its full power capacity (e.g. when operating in strong "
"currents)"
msgstr "在具有飞控稳定功能的模式下，稳定化仍可能导致飞行器使用全部功率（例如在强水流中作业时）"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:70 e637849484cf40eb9417f5efa9e73d90
msgid ""
"Joystick gain can be controlled by the pilot using ``gain_*`` "
":ref:`buttons`, and/or can be configured with the parameters"
msgstr "摇杆增益可由飞手通过 ``gain_*`` :ref:`buttons` 进行控制，也可通过以下参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:72 c920e69443f445648ef45aea8c7a73ef
msgid ""
":ref:`JS_GAIN_MIN<JS_GAIN_MIN>`, :ref:`JS_GAIN_MAX<JS_GAIN_MAX>`, and "
":ref:`JS_GAIN_DEFAULT<JS_GAIN_DEFAULT>` for its limits and starting value"
msgstr ""
":ref:`JS_GAIN_MIN<JS_GAIN_MIN>`、:ref:`JS_GAIN_MAX<JS_GAIN_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`JS_GAIN_DEFAULT<JS_GAIN_DEFAULT>` 用于设置其限制和初始值"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:73 c35e35ba9aab4ab1809b0966b78e72ec
msgid ""
":ref:`JS_THR_GAIN<JS_THR_GAIN>` for an additional scaling applied to "
"vertical inputs, to either reduce them further or boost them relative to "
"horizontal/turning inputs"
msgstr ":ref:`JS_THR_GAIN<JS_THR_GAIN>` 用于对垂直输入附加缩放，以相对于水平/转向输入进一步降低或提升垂直输入"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:74 eb550daabfc442de997787493d598773
msgid ""
":ref:`JS_GAIN_STEPS<JS_GAIN_STEPS>` to determine how much the gain "
"changes with each increment/decrement button press"
msgstr ":ref:`JS_GAIN_STEPS<JS_GAIN_STEPS>` 用于确定每次按下增加/减少按钮时增益的变化量"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:75 653a7598ead34b748ff463b0a1ab31e2
msgid ""
"When using radio channels for RC control of the vehicle, it is possible "
"to ignore small RC stick adjustments and timing inconsistencies using "
":ref:`RCn_DZ<RC1_DZ>` to specify the deadzone for each RC channel"
msgstr "使用无线电通道对飞行器进行遥控时，可通过 :ref:`RCn_DZ<RC1_DZ>` 为每个遥控通道指定死区，从而忽略微小的遥控摇杆调整和时序不一致"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:76 3f4775fd9c4646f4be9cc6538aa87d8e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Attitude stabilisation limits the vehicle's maximum lean angle "
"(roll/pitch away from level) to :ref:`ATC_ANGLE_MAX<ATC_ANGLE_MAX>`"
msgstr "姿态稳定化将飞行器的最大倾斜角（横滚/俯仰偏离水平）限制为 :ref:`ANGLE_MAX<ANGLE_MAX>`"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:77 f1db5b1be1214f48aaa1ed61af41a46c
msgid ""
"Automatic depth control (in modes like ALT_HOLD, SURFTRAK, POSHOLD, and "
"CIRCLE) can be configured with the parameters"
msgstr "自动深度控制（在 ALT_HOLD、SURFTRAK、POSHOLD 和 CIRCLE 等模式下）可通过以下参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/pilot-control.rst:79 782872152bd24f849ca53215d8e8e133
msgid ""
":ref:`THR_DZ<THR_DZ>` for the throttle deadzone, to avoid small joystick "
